  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1204.31 Soft coating",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1204.31 \"Soft coating\" means any coating that provides a soft tactile feel similar to leather and a rich leather-like appearance when applied to plastic interior automotive parts and exterior business machine parts.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
